# The rule above is unanchored, so it also swallows the QA evidence tree. That evidence is
# deliberately version-controlled: the findings in "QA August 17"/*.md cite these payloads and
# scripts, and a reviewer cannot check a claim against evidence that was never committed.
!/QA August 17/artifacts/
apps/api/tmp_artifacts/

